# GitHub's "Cite this repository" reads this file. Keep `version` and `date-released` equal to
# ionomos/pyproject.toml and the CHANGELOG at each release (docs/VISION.md, "Versioning and support").
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Ionomos, please cite it as below, and also cite the tools whose
  methods it ports (FragPipe-Analyst, limma, CurveCurator; see README.md, License).
type: software
title: "Ionomos: proteomics results to a checked, self-contained report, and a drop-folder watcher that runs FragPipe"
authors:
